url: 'https://statisticshealtheconomics.github.io/outstandR/'
abstract: >-
  An R package for model-based standardisation for indirect treatment comparison (ITC).
  For the problem of indirect treatment comparison with limited subject-level data,
  this package provides tools for model-based standardisation with several different
  computation approaches. It facilitates outcome regression standardisation using
  model-based approaches when head-to-head clinical trials are absent and trial
  populations differ in effect modifiers.
